~C. Because punctuation is the only concern.#Incorrect. Respect and representation matter. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
=D. Because respectful adaptation avoids stereotypes and careless distortion.#Correct. Careful treatment protects meaning and audience trust.
}

